DotPoints:
One Dock. No Limits;
Engineered for performance, the ThinkPad Universal USB-C Dock quickly pays for itself with increased productivity, enhanced dynamic power charging to Notebook, max 100W charging. If you can think it, your dock can do it;
One Cable. No Hassle;
With 11+ thoughtfully placed ports, the ThinkPad Universal USB-C Dock delivers unmatched performance while decluttering your desk;
Entire Fleet. One Manager

The ThinkPad® Thunderbolt™ 5 Smart Dock 7500 support upto 180W PD 3.1 charge power;
3 x 8K@60Hz + 1 x 4K@60Hz or 2 x 4K@240Hz + 2 x 4K@120Hz display support;
Data transfer speed up to 80Gbps in standard mode or 120Gbps in Bandwidth Boost mode;
Support vPro / AMT Pass Through;
2.5Gb Ethernet supports WOL, PXE Boot, MAC address pass through on ThinkPad Notebooks;
Fleet Smart Management with Lenovo™ Accessories Fleet Manager (LAFM);
Universal Dock Compatibility a cross different Operating Systems, Windows, Linux, macOS 15 Sequoia and above

The ThinkPad® USB4 Smart Dock 5500 supports 65W PD 3.1 charge power;
Data speed up to 40Gbps to system;
1 x 8K@60Hz or 4 x 4K@60Hz display support;
1Gb Ethernet, support WOL, PXE Boot, MAC address pass thru on ThinkPad Notebooks;
Fleet Smart Management with Lenovo™ Accessories Fleet Manager (LAFM);
Universal Dock Compatibility a cross different Operating System
